{"id": "striviaqa0026", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Acmeism relates to poetry from the early 20 th century in Russia. It was a movement that emerged as a reaction against the more emotional and free verse styles of its time, emphasizing precision, clarity, and form.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0034", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "They received the 1 9 62 Nobel Prize for Medicine for their discovery of the double-h elix structure of DNA, which revolutionized our understanding of genetic s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0042", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The cathedral in Red Square is called the Cathedral of Our Lady of the Sign, also known as Saint Basil' s Cathedral. It was built in the 16th century to celebrate a military victory over the Tatar-Mong ol forces. Its colorful, unique design makes it one of Moscow's most iconic landmark s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0050", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "August 2nd, 19 90 saw Iraq inva ding Kuwait, spark ing a series of events that cul minated in the First Gulf War.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
