{"id": "striviaqa0066", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The triangular part of a horse' s hoof is called the frog. It's located at the front of the hoof and helps with balance and shock absorption when the horse walks or runs.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0074", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Who has been under house arrest for 15 of the past 21 years and was released from the latest sentence on November 1 3, 2010? That would be Liu Xiaobo. He is a Chinese dissident writer and human rights activist who was awarded the No bel Peace Prize in 2010 for his work promoting democracy and civil liberties in China. The release mentioned refers to his most recent prison term ending, though he remained under restrictions afterward s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0082", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The derived SI unit of pressure is the pascal.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0090", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The UNHRC, or the United Nations Human Rights Council, focuses on issues related to human rights. This includes things like protecting people' s basic rights and freedom s around the world. They look at problems such as discrimination, viola tions of civil liberties, and situations where people might be treated unfairly or un justly. Their goal is to make sure that everyone can live with dignity and respect for their rights.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0098", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "In rugby union, the player who wears shirt number 15 is the fullback. This position is usually the last line of defense and often plays a key role in attack as well.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0106", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "To Kill a Mockingbird.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
